<view class="page"><view class="section-title">选择、调整并核对图片</view><view class="notice">支持打印体表格截图与清晰照片。手写、严重透视、模糊或复杂布局需重新整理。姓名只做精确匹配。</view><button class="secondary" bindtap="choose" disabled="{{busy}}">重新选择图片</button>
  <view wx:if="{{path}}" class="card panel"><image class="image-preview" src="{{path}}" mode="aspectFit" style="transform:rotate({{rotation}}deg)" /><button class="secondary" bindtap="rotate" disabled="{{busy}}">顺时针旋转 90°（当前 {{rotation}}°）</button><view class="muted">裁剪范围按旋转后图片的百分比填写，0–100；保留完整表头和你的姓名。</view><view class="crop-fields"><view>左 %<input type="number" value="{{left}}" data-field="left" bindinput="field" /></view><view>上 %<input type="number" value="{{top}}" data-field="top" bindinput="field" /></view><view>右 %<input type="number" value="{{right}}" data-field="right" bindinput="field" /></view><view>下 %<input type="number" value="{{bottom}}" data-field="bottom" bindinput="field" /></view></view><input class="field" value="{{name}}" data-field="name" bindinput="field" placeholder="完整姓名，如星辰奕歌" /><input class="field" type="number" value="{{year}}" data-field="year" bindinput="field" placeholder="缺少年份时使用" /><button class="primary" bindtap="recognize" disabled="{{busy}}" loading="{{busy}}">{{blocks.length ? '按修正文字重新提取' : '识别并提取安排'}}</button></view>
  <view wx:if="{{blocks.length}}"><view class="section-title">{{count}} 项安排 · {{pendingCount}} 项待确认</view><view wx:if="{{!reliable}}" class="notice">布局未能可靠还原，所有线索需逐项确认。</view><view class="muted">对照图片核对文字。以下分数仅是文字识别分数，不代表日程正确率。</view><image wx:for="{{crops}}" wx:key="id" class="evidence-image" src="{{item.path}}" mode="widthFix" /><view wx:for="{{blocks}}" wx:key="id" class="card panel"><view class="muted">{{item.cell}} · 坐标 {{item.box}} · 文字分数 {{item.scoreLabel}}</view><input class="field" value="{{item.text}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindinput="correct" maxlength="1000" /><view class="muted">原识别：{{item.original}}</view></view><button class="primary" bindtap="add" disabled="{{busy}}">加入导入批次，继续核对</button></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view>
</view>
